#. 数据库字段：Item[960].ToolTip
#: Server.MirDB Item[960].ToolTip
msgctxt "Item:960:ToolTip"
msgid "Open this box to receive a random wonder.\r\nWonderStrength is based on BoxStrength."
msgstr "打开此盒可获得随机神物。\r\n神物强度取决于盒子强度。"

#. 数据库字段：Item[961].ToolTip
#: Server.MirDB Item[961].ToolTip
